WEBVTT

00:00:03.740 --> 00:00:05.075
[both groaning]

00:00:05.117 --> 00:00:07.244
[strained grunting]

00:00:07.286 --> 00:00:09.704
Let's go, let's go, let's go! Let's go!

00:00:09.746 --> 00:00:11.664
[squeals] [whooping]

00:00:13.083 --> 00:00:15.628
-Who are you guys? -Huh?

00:00:15.668 --> 00:00:16.711
Who are we?

00:00:16.753 --> 00:00:18.797
Who... are we?

00:00:18.839 --> 00:00:21.716
We... are the Flushed Pets!

00:00:21.758 --> 00:00:25.638
and now we are out for revenge! Thrown away by our owners,

00:00:25.678 --> 00:00:28.723
but with biting and scratching. It's like a club,

00:00:28.765 --> 00:00:29.724
[grunts]

00:00:29.766 --> 00:00:30.976
T-Take us with you.

00:00:31.018 --> 00:00:32.685
[sniffing]

00:00:32.727 --> 00:00:34.729
I don't think so, pets!

00:00:34.771 --> 00:00:37.732
of domestication all over you. Yeah, you got the stench

00:00:37.774 --> 00:00:40.235
and now you're gonna burn. You chose your side,

00:00:40.277 --> 00:00:42.737
Who you calling pets? No! Stop!

00:00:42.779 --> 00:00:44.739
You got it all wrong. I ain't no pet.

00:00:44.781 --> 00:00:46.992
We're-we're just like you guys. We hate humans.

00:00:47.034 --> 00:00:48.743
-Uh, yeah! That's-that's right. -Hate them.

00:00:48.785 --> 00:00:50.745
don't get me started on people. Oh, man,

00:00:50.787 --> 00:00:52.331
Am I right, Duke? [chuckles] Yeah.

00:00:52.373 --> 00:00:54.333
That's why we burned our collars, man!

00:00:54.375 --> 00:00:55.876
We burned 'em to the ground!

00:00:55.917 --> 00:00:57.878
-And killed our owners. -Yeah... Wait a minute.

00:00:57.919 --> 00:01:00.755
That's too far, maybe? No, they dig it.

00:01:00.797 --> 00:01:02.466
-Yes, we whacked 'em. -Yeah, that's right.

00:01:02.508 --> 00:01:03.842
Bang, bang, with our own paws!

00:01:03.884 --> 00:01:06.261
for every owner I killed... If I had a dime

00:01:06.303 --> 00:01:09.097
-...I'd have a dime. -Oh, yeah!

00:01:09.139 --> 00:01:11.099
'Cause I just killed the one.

00:01:11.141 --> 00:01:13.519
Ooh... whoo!

00:01:13.561 --> 00:01:15.270
Aw, y'all cold-blooded.

00:01:15.312 --> 00:01:17.772
Aw, man, you remind me of my boy Ricky.

00:01:17.814 --> 00:01:18.899
He died though.

00:01:18.940 --> 00:01:20.942
[taps plays faintly] R-I-P, Ricky!

00:01:20.984 --> 00:01:22.403
You know, the truth is,

00:01:22.444 --> 00:01:23.778
the struggle could use some more muscle.

00:01:23.820 --> 00:01:25.780
I'll tell you what. All right, look,

00:01:25.822 --> 00:01:27.782
We'll bust the both of you out of here, but understand this.

00:01:27.824 --> 00:01:29.951
-From now on, you work for me. -That's fine.

00:01:29.993 --> 00:01:31.620
Sounds like a fun challenge.

00:01:32.913 --> 00:01:35.624
[grunts]  All right, guys, let's do this!

00:01:35.666 --> 00:01:38.043
[squealing, shouting, grunting]

00:01:38.085 --> 00:01:39.169
[Max screams]

00:01:39.211 --> 00:01:41.004
To the sewers!

00:01:41.046 --> 00:01:42.797
The sewers?

00:01:42.839 --> 00:01:44.550
What are y'all waiting for?

00:01:44.592 --> 00:01:45.842
I'm not playing!

00:01:45.884 --> 00:01:48.803
I said... to the sewers!

00:01:48.845 --> 00:01:50.472
[snorting]

00:01:50.514 --> 00:01:52.349
[Duke grunts, screams]

00:01:52.391 --> 00:01:53.808
[Max screams]

00:01:53.850 --> 00:01:55.769
[Snowball yells]

00:01:55.810 --> 00:01:59.106
the revolution, suckers! SNOWBALL: Long live

00:01:59.147 --> 00:02:01.775
♪ ♪

00:02:02.443 --> 00:02:03.569
[grunts]

00:02:03.611 --> 00:02:04.945
I can do it.

00:02:04.986 --> 00:02:06.655
[pants]

00:02:08.865 --> 00:02:09.866
Oh!

00:02:10.867 --> 00:02:12.536
Max?

00:02:13.287 --> 00:02:14.829
Max?

00:02:14.871 --> 00:02:16.873
Max! Max!

00:02:16.915 --> 00:02:18.125
Max?

00:02:18.166 --> 00:02:20.335
Max? Max?

00:02:20.377 --> 00:02:21.878
[panting]

00:02:23.922 --> 00:02:25.799
[strained grunting]

00:02:32.180 --> 00:02:34.808
Oh, where are you, Max?

00:02:35.934 --> 00:02:37.436
[sighs]

00:02:37.478 --> 00:02:40.188
TIBERIUS [echoing] Looks like you could use a little help.

00:02:40.230 --> 00:02:42.816
-Who said that? -Over here.

00:02:42.857 --> 00:02:45.736
and foreboding shed. In this dark

00:02:53.910 --> 00:02:56.121
Uh... hello?

00:02:56.163 --> 00:02:58.457
I can see for miles.

00:02:58.499 --> 00:03:01.876
I'll find your friend. If you let me out,

00:03:01.918 --> 00:03:03.128
Wow! Really?

00:03:03.170 --> 00:03:05.297
Aw, you're so sweet.

00:03:05.339 --> 00:03:07.215
You're sweet, too.

00:03:07.257 --> 00:03:09.259
Oh, ho-ho. Thanks, stranger.

00:03:09.301 --> 00:03:10.969
[sniffs] But not too sweet.

00:03:11.011 --> 00:03:14.848
salty, gamey thing going on. There's also a, uh,

00:03:14.889 --> 00:03:16.016
Yeah, that's me. [chuckles]

00:03:16.057 --> 00:03:19.227
let's get you out of that shed. Come on,

00:03:19.269 --> 00:03:20.813
Yeah, that's it.

00:03:20.854 --> 00:03:22.897
the pile of bones. Just step over

00:03:22.939 --> 00:03:25.609
Pile of bones. Okay, will do.

00:03:25.651 --> 00:03:27.820
I sure hope Max is safe. [sighs]

00:03:27.861 --> 00:03:29.904
You're a very thoughtful food.

00:03:29.946 --> 00:03:32.491
"Food"? I didn't say that. I said "friend."

00:03:32.533 --> 00:03:34.743
I said... I meant "food." [laughs]

00:03:34.785 --> 00:03:37.371
You know what I meant. "F... Friend."

00:03:37.412 --> 00:03:39.914
I found you, uh... I am sure lucky

00:03:39.956 --> 00:03:43.669
Tiberius. And yes, this is a very good thing for you,

00:03:43.711 --> 00:03:46.463
this whole meeting me thing.

00:03:46.505 --> 00:03:48.923
Take off my hood.

00:03:50.967 --> 00:03:52.927
[gasps]

00:03:52.969 --> 00:03:54.304
[screeching]

00:03:54.346 --> 00:03:56.139
[screams]

00:03:56.181 --> 00:03:57.432
[screeches]

00:03:57.474 --> 00:04:00.352
[screaming]

00:04:00.394 --> 00:04:02.479
Aah! The chain!

00:04:02.521 --> 00:04:03.980
[Tiberius groaning]

00:04:04.022 --> 00:04:06.400
Oh! You tried to eat me!

00:04:06.441 --> 00:04:08.360
I'm sorry! [sobbing]

00:04:08.402 --> 00:04:09.611
You should be sorry!

00:04:09.653 --> 00:04:11.196
You deserve to be locked up!

00:04:11.238 --> 00:04:12.989
You're a bad, bad bird!

00:04:13.031 --> 00:04:13.990
I can't help it!

00:04:14.032 --> 00:04:15.950
killer instincts! I was born with

00:04:15.992 --> 00:04:18.495
-That is just no excuse! -You're right.

00:04:18.537 --> 00:04:20.497
Even for a predator, I'm selfish.

00:04:20.539 --> 00:04:22.750
I'm a selfish predator.

00:04:22.791 --> 00:04:25.001
I have no friends. It's no wonder

00:04:25.043 --> 00:04:25.753
Nobody.

00:04:25.794 --> 00:04:27.962
[sobbing] I... I...

00:04:28.004 --> 00:04:30.090
-This is hopeless. I... -Oh, don't...

00:04:30.131 --> 00:04:31.925
There's no need to cry.

00:04:31.966 --> 00:04:34.261
I yelled at you before. I'm sorry that

00:04:34.302 --> 00:04:35.970
Please take off the chain.

00:04:36.012 --> 00:04:38.973
This time I'll help you. I promise.

00:04:39.015 --> 00:04:40.975
Tiberius...

00:04:41.017 --> 00:04:44.479
completely horrible, but, um... this is gonna sound

00:04:44.521 --> 00:04:46.314
I don't fully trust you.

00:04:47.357 --> 00:04:49.192
[sobbing]

00:04:49.234 --> 00:04:50.694
Oh, no, no, no, well, but...

00:04:50.736 --> 00:04:52.780
I guess everyone deserves a second chance.

00:04:52.821 --> 00:04:54.698
a lonely, old bird. And you are just

00:04:54.740 --> 00:04:55.990
And you do have weird manners

00:04:56.032 --> 00:04:58.577
in a weird shed on a roof. because you live

00:04:58.619 --> 00:05:00.161
So I'll tell you what. [sniffles]

00:05:00.203 --> 00:05:02.372
If you find Max...

00:05:02.414 --> 00:05:03.998
I'll be your best friend!

00:05:04.040 --> 00:05:06.293
Best friend?

00:05:06.334 --> 00:05:08.670
You and me?

00:05:08.712 --> 00:05:11.757
♪ Ooh, you make me live ♪ Whoa!

00:05:11.799 --> 00:05:13.174
[laughter]

00:05:13.216 --> 00:05:15.302
♪ Oh, you're my best friend ♪ Whoa!

00:05:15.343 --> 00:05:16.720
[laughing]

00:05:16.762 --> 00:05:18.889
♪ That I ever had ♪ [whooping]

00:05:18.931 --> 00:05:20.933
♪ I've been with you such a long time ♪

00:05:20.974 --> 00:05:22.309
[screeching] [laughs]

00:05:22.350 --> 00:05:24.269
♪ You're my best friend. ♪ [squirrel screaming]

00:05:26.020 --> 00:05:28.273
Yes! That sounds nice.

00:05:28.315 --> 00:05:29.524
Let's do this.

00:05:29.566 --> 00:05:31.652
Okay.

00:05:32.569 --> 00:05:34.404
[gasps]

00:05:34.446 --> 00:05:36.824
[sighs]

00:05:36.865 --> 00:05:39.409
So what does this Max look like?

00:05:39.451 --> 00:05:40.994
Brown and white.

00:05:41.035 --> 00:05:43.956
roguishly handsome. He's a short-hair,

00:05:43.997 --> 00:05:45.666
He's got a sparkle in his eye.

00:05:45.707 --> 00:05:47.626
He sounds dreamy.

00:05:47.668 --> 00:05:50.044
Oh, you have no idea. [chuckles]

00:05:50.086 --> 00:05:51.045
I mean, what?

00:05:51.087 --> 00:05:52.213
Whatever.

00:05:52.255 --> 00:05:54.466
Shut up. [scoffs] Mm-mm.

00:05:54.508 --> 00:05:56.510
If my owner comes,

00:05:56.551 --> 00:05:59.262
and pretend to be me. put on the hood

00:05:59.304 --> 00:06:01.014
Okay, thank you!

